# vehje-ir. shared representation

The framework's shared IR, the crate every other framework crate depends
on. The eleven Core substrate forms, the `Family` extension trait plus
effect classification, the family-set and effect-set typestate (reusing
`hilavitkutin-api`'s `AccessSet`), the node builder, and interner
integration. No algorithms; the data contract the passes and targets read
and write. `#![no_std]`, no alloc: the IR lives in caller-provided memory.
